[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4901239997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4901239997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4901239997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJCL8vQ","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T07:27:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T08:19:03Z","body":"Do you by any chance know the hardware that the people experiencing the crash have?\n\nAlso, are you using custom export templates?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4901239997/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4901627534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4901627534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4901627534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJCjmjg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T08:18:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T08:18:00Z","body":"> I can share a link (or alt way?) to the Windows and Linux client applications on my website privately with staff if needed.\n\nWe cannot do this for basic computer safety reasons, never share executable content for an issue\n\nThis isn't enough information, please provide more details like crash reports and hardware details","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4901627534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4908298817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4908298817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4908298817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJI6yQQ","user":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T20:20:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T20:22:13Z","body":"@AThousandShips \nI will get the hardware data from a couple of  users.  I will also have them test a debug version of the Godot built Windows application and if it generates any crash reporting data I will post it. Since I cant get it to crash on Wine I cant get any crash report data locally. \n\nI was really hoping someone out there had encountered this issue. To me it’s crazy that the Godot built application runs on Wine and not on Windows.\n\nCould this be a credential or application security issue? I am exporting the application as an unsigned application.\n\nI’m also interested in any sound issues that may relate to my issue.  I will prepare this a fore mentioned debug test to use a dummy sound driver to help isolate the issue (just in case its sound).\n\nI will have some user data shortly. \n\n@NoNormalDev \nOddly, I was. I had thought the same thing, that maybe my custom built export templates where at fault. So I downloaded Godot 4.6.3 and its official export templates and imported my game project. I built a windows application and the same 'exact' issue is present. So, not the templates.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4908298817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4912686252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4912686252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4912686252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJNGkrA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T08:06:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T08:06:20Z","body":"> To me it’s crazy that the Godot built application runs on Wine and not on Windows.\n\nNever heard it before so not sure what's wrong here, it could be user error, can you test it in a fresh project?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4912686252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4915682625","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4915682625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4915682625,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJP9dQQ","user":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T14:10:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T14:11:53Z","body":"@AThousandShips \nI will try a test app (asset example) soon for comparison. I have my client app out to a few users to test to get crash data.  I've disconnected sound and Text to Speech in the hope TTS might be the issue as it is seldom used by developers and might cause this rare issue.\n\nI have never seen this issue  as well. I was shocked that the built Windows app was crashing when it runs on Wine. The Linux version runs with no issues on Linux Desktop and as a dedicated server on a VPS. \n\nI will have more soon.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4915682625/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4916860292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4916860292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4916860292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJRFVhA","user":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:16:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T16:16:06Z","body":"@AThousandShips \nA little news.\n\nThe Windows client I built with a 'Dummy' sound driver and no TTS is working on Windows. My hunch was right and this maybe an issue with text to speech. It also could be something I've done wrong using the bus system in Godot, but I don't quite see that as the issue. I am using 8 master bus'es and a lot of connected sounds for game impact and weapons fire with each having 8 'max_polyphony'. I hope that is not too much for Godot as it's spread across 20-30 sounds playing any one time.\n\n\nI'll have more as I isolate the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4916860292/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4916871890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4916871890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4916871890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJRGC0g","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:17:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T16:18:04Z","body":"(No need to ping me each time it just adds unnecessary noise and I'm not the only one doing triage on this)\n\nOnce you have clear reproduction steps or an MRP make sure to update the issue itself ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4916871890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4916875332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4916875332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4916875332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJRGQRA","user":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:17:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T16:17:52Z","body":"*Got it","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4916875332/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4982705283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4982705283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4982705283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKP4Mgw","user":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T16:04:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:04:23Z","body":"It turns out once I got a 'release' build of my Windows client running on Windows 11 it crashed again and will not run. Users report the log file generated by Godot only showing two warning/errors:\n\n```\nWARNING: Sending failed! at: enet_socket_send (thirdparty/enet/enet_godot.cpp:532) \nERROR: Condition \"!_is_active()\" is true. Returning: nullptr at: get_host (modules/enet/enet_multiplayer_peer.cpp:452)\n```\n\nI have never seen this error and can’t explain it. After logging this error, the Godot 4.6.3 release built Windows client crashes. I googled it and found only one result. An [open Godot issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115890) on GitHub that appears similar in scope, but I am not sure. \n\nI have no idea what to do from here. I could use some guidance on how/what the issue is so that I can explore a solution.  My client application runs fine on Linux Desktop and on a VPS as a Linux dedicated server. This ‘enet_socket_send’ issue occurs on Windows ‘release’ builds. Debug Windows builds (Godot 4.6.3) run with no issue.\n\nUsers all have Windows 11 reporting the crash issue with my game client built (release) on Godot 4.6.3. User have typical game rig hardware with Nvidia GPU's.\n\nI hope someone can help as I am not sure what this warring/error is.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4982705283/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4997554360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121029#issuecomment-4997554360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121029","id":4997554360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKeCguA","user":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T23:52:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T23:54:20Z","body":"After digging into my code base I discovered the following issue.  To get the host form a ENetMultiplayerPeer created client I was using the method get_host() instead of the property value 'host'. Below is the original code causing the error and then my revision using the 'host' property vale instead of get_host()\n\n```\nvar my_host = ENetMultiplayerPeer.new()\nmy_host.create_client(ip,DEFAULT_PORT, 20)\nmy_host.get_host().compress(my_host.get_host().COMPRESS_ZLIB)\nmy_host.transfer_mode = my_host.TRANSFER_MODE_RELIABLE\nmy_host.set_target_peer(my_host.TARGET_PEER_SERVER)\nmy_host.get_host().dtls_client_setup(\"\",TLSOptions.client_unsafe(cert) )\n```\n\n```\nvar my_host = ENetMultiplayerPeer.new()\nmy_host.create_client(ip,DEFAULT_PORT, 20)\nmy_host.host.compress(my_host.host.COMPRESS_ZLIB)\nmy_host.transfer_mode = my_host.TRANSFER_MODE_RELIABLE\nmy_host.set_target_peer(my_host.TARGET_PEER_SERVER)\nmy_host.host.dtls_client_setup(\"\",TLSOptions.client_unsafe(cert) )\n```\n\nThese changes seem to have stopped the crashing issue in Windows 11 with no \"Sending failed!\" errors/warnings. I have been working on this project since Godot 3.5 so the implementation may have changed over time, or I had it wrong all along. \n\nI am marking this closed as it's not crashing now and I believe I have found the issue.\n\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4997554360/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]